summary:
  When a pause is a window old the engine stops its buffer as a Stop would.

history:
  The end of a capture is not the end of the pause: the listener left a
  place and Play has to come back to it. The writer is signalled, the folder
  stays, and the arm is the one a writer leaves that ended by itself under a
  park.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          writerUp = false;
          slideFrozen = true;
      }

replace:
          disarm();
      }

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_pause_that_reaches_the_windows_edge_ends_the_capture_and_keeps_what_was_cut.
